# Credentials and anything shaped like them. Nothing in this repository needs a
# token on disk: the reference MCP configs read ${DATABRICKS_TOKEN} from the
# environment precisely so that no file here can carry one by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.databrickscfg

# What SETUP.md tells you to create. If you follow a setup page inside this
# clone rather than in your own project, these appear — they are your machine's
# configuration, not this repository's content, so `git status` stays clean.
# Anchored with a leading slash: a bare filename in .gitignore matches at every
# depth, which would swallow the tracked harness/*/AGENTS.md.
/.claude/
/.mcp.json
/.cursor/
/.github/copilot-instructions.md
/opencode.json
/AGENTS.md
/config.toml

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
